: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #983d2b;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #186974;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6641bc;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">3,057</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">8,600</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>Based on the traits expressed in the offspring, identify the <span style="color: DarkRed;"><strong>parental genotype combinations</strong></span>. These are the allele combinations that the parent fruit flies originally carried.</p> <p>More than one genotype will be correct. Select all that apply.</p>
PROMPT_105E_6C8A
loadMacros('parserCheckboxList.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_105E_6C8A_CHOICE_1';
bkm
LITERAL_105E_6C8A_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_105E_6C8A_CHOICE_2';
bk+
LITERAL_105E_6C8A_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_105E_6C8A_CHOICE_3';
b+m
LITERAL_105E_6C8A_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_105E_6C8A_CHOICE_4';
b++
LITERAL_105E_6C8A_CHOICE_4
